      <item>
       <widget class="QLabel" name="cardsHelp">
        <property name="text">
         <string>The cards in slots 1 and 2 are synced, file and folder cards. A card keeps its name across devices: Mcd001.ps2 here and mcd001.ps2 in ARMSX2 are the same card. Saves on file cards upload as they are made; saves on folder cards upload when the game closes. When a save changed on two devices, the newest wins and the other stays in the save's history.</string>
